    '2000|2637|01/11/2000 10:25:41 AM|SB411|S|==CANCELLED==; SC2, Pg.17|01/11/2000 10:25:41 AM',
    '2000|2637|01/13/2000 04:30:01 PM|SB411|S|==RESCHEDULED== Feb.10, Room 104, LOB, 9:00 a.m.; SC3, Pg.7|01/13/2000 04:30:01 PM',
