    "MAJ REPORT OTP FOR MAR03  (VOTE 17-0;CC)|02/19/1993 04:44:37 PM",
    "ADOPTED; HJ31,P684 + 734|03/03/1993 02:20:49 PM",
    "SUBCOM HEARING FEB02 09:30 RM303,LOB    FOR: E&A|01/21/1994 10:56:36 AM",
