# Real rows: Docket_db_2009-2010.txt lines 12981-12982 (HB 1587);
# Docket_db_2011-2012.txt lines 15876-15877 (HB 1472), 15952-15955 (HB 1284),
# 22197 (PET 29) and 3861, 3863-3864 (HB 523, less its cancelled hearing);
